# REQ-002 README

## Scope

This candidate emits a compact Python auth module for Slice-1 API authentication and RBAC behavior.

Implemented scope:

- normalize OIDC bearer claims into a stable actor context
- normalize SAML assertion attributes into the same actor context shape
- enforce `401` for anonymous callers
- enforce `403` when required permissions are missing
- propagate actor identity into downstream write and audit sinks
- redact bearer tokens and SAML assertions from logs
- expose a small test surface:
  - `GET /auth/me`
  - `POST /documents/write-test`

## Emitted files

- `runs/kit/REQ-002/src/backend/auth/main_module.py`
  - auth normalization
  - request authentication
  - permission checks
  - FastAPI app factory
  - audit/write propagation seam
- `runs/kit/REQ-002/test/backend/auth/test_req_behavior.py`
  - acceptance-oriented pytest coverage
- `runs/kit/REQ-002/docs/README_REQ-002.md`
- `runs/kit/REQ-002/docs/KIT_REQ-002.md`
- `runs/kit/REQ-002/ci/LTC.json`
- `runs/kit/REQ-002/ci/HOWTO.md`

